    "sections": {
        "description": "ShopBar is a modern, lightweight e-commerce WordPress theme designed for online stores. Fully WooCommerce-ready, it offers a clean, responsive layout with a custom top bar, category header navigation, flexible footer widget columns, and extensive Customizer options for colors, typography, and layout. It supports custom logos, featured images, translation, and includes performance optimizations for fast page loads — perfect for building beautiful, conversion-focused shops. ShopBar works great for fashion and clothing boutiques, electronics and gadget stores, home decor and furniture shops, beauty and cosmetics brands, jewelry stores, and general merchandise retailers — anywhere you need a polished storefront with smooth product browsing."
    },
